#!/usr/local/bin/dyalogscript
⍝ JsonRpcCl (Content-Length-framed JSON-RPC, ADR D13) against the toy
⍝ CL server — the committed, network-free test. See
⍝ scratch-equivalent manual verification against a real LSP server
⍝ (pyright-langserver via npx) mentioned in the ADR; not committed
⍝ here since it needs network access and an npm install on first run.
⎕IO←1
⎕FIX'file://D:/devel/mcp-client/src/JsonRpcCl.dyalog'

h←JsonRpcCl.Connect'python' 'D:\devel\mcp-client\examples\toy-jsonrpc-cl-server.py'

r1←h JsonRpcCl.Call('echo'(text:'hello'))
⎕←'echo -> ',r1.result

r2←h JsonRpcCl.Call('add'(a:3 ⋄ b:4))
⎕←'add -> ',⍕r2.result

⍝ Unknown method must come back as an ordinary JSON-RPC error
⍝ response, same contract as JsonRpc (ADR D6).
r3←h JsonRpcCl.Call'not/a/real/method'
⎕←'unknown method -> has error field: ',⍕0≠⎕NC'r3.error'

⍝ Receive timeout, same contract as JsonRpc/Shell.
h.Timeout←2
:Trap 999
    h JsonRpcCl.Call('sleep'(seconds:5))
    ⎕←'FAIL: expected timeout'
:Else
    ⎕←'sleep timeout signaled ok: ',⎕DM
:EndTrap

JsonRpcCl.Disconnect h
⎕←'status after disconnect=',h.Status
⎕OFF
